    "number": 15,
    "summary": "1–2, The Lord’s arm is over all the earth; 3–6, To preach the gospel and save souls is the thing of most worth.",
    "chapterAugmentations": [
      {
        "type": "introduction",
        "text": "Revelation given through Joseph Smith the Prophet to John Whitmer, at Fayette, New York, June 1829 (see theheading to section 14). The message is intimately and impressively personal in that the Lord tells of what was known only to John Whitmer and Himself. John Whitmer later became one of the Eight Witnesses to the Book of Mormon."
      }
    ],
    "verses": [
